# RestroPulse Intelligence Worker - Environment Variables
# Copy to .env and fill in real values. Server-side only: no key-shaped value
# here ever reaches the web bundle or demo fixtures (module CLAUDE.md §11).

NODE_ENV=development

# MongoDB Connection (required) -- reads intelligence_reports / competitor_cache,
# writes deltas + emits events into the existing `events` collection.
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://username:password@cluster.mongodb.net/?retryWrites=true&w=majority
MONGODB_DB_NAME=restropulse

# Weekly re-scan schedule (node-cron, Asia/Kolkata). Default: Mondays 03:00 IST.
CRON_INTELLIGENCE=0 3 * * 1

# Daily snapshot loop schedule (Brief 08, node-cron, Asia/Kolkata). Default: 02:00 IST.
CRON_INTELLIGENCE_DAILY=0 2 * * *

# Daily snapshot loop kill switch. Default: enabled (in the test env it defaults
# to disabled so suites never make external calls). Set to false to pause it.
# INTELLIGENCE_DAILY_ENABLED=true

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Places (New) + Anthropic keys are required ONLY once the in-process
# re-scan seam is wired (see src/rescan.ts). The default seam enqueues scans
# for the API pipeline, which owns these keys, so they are commented out here.
# When the scan pipeline is promoted to a shared package and run in-process by
# this worker, uncomment and populate them (never in web / fixtures).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-google-places-new-api-key
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key
